---
const faqs = [
  [
    'What is a bag?',
    'A themed basket of tokens with a fixed allocation, like "AI Infrastructure" or "Frontier AI Labs". You see every holding, its weight, the sources behind it and the risks before you buy. A bag is not an ETF or a managed fund.',
  ],
  [
    'Am I buying actual shares?',
    'No. You buy tokens: xStocks track listed shares and PreStocks give exposure to private companies. Each issuer has its own structure, rights and restrictions. Read the issuer documentation and our disclosures.',
  ],
  [
    'How does a story connect to a bag?',
    "Each story is linked to the bags it touches. An AI model reads the publisher's excerpt and says which holdings it affects, the share of the bag they make up, and what is still uncertain. When there's no validated analysis, the app says so. It is never a forecast.",
  ],
  [
    'Who controls my wallet?',
    'You do. Your wallet is secured by Privy. Every swap is quoted by Jupiter on Solana and you approve each one. Newsbid never trades on your behalf.',
  ],
  [
    'What should I know before buying?',
    'You can lose everything you put in. Liquidity, prices, issuer restrictions and availability change. Pre-IPO tokens carry extra risk, and congressional disclosures are delayed reports, not live trades.',
  ],
];
---

<section id="faq" class="section-y faq">
  <div class="container-x faq__grid">
    <div class="faq__intro" data-reveal>
      <span class="kicker kicker--brand kicker--rule">Questions</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Straight <em>answers.</em></h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        More detail in the <a class="text-link" href="/disclosures">disclosures</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__list" data-reveal>
      {faqs.map(([question, answer], index) => (
        <details open={index === 0}>
          <summary>
            <span class="faq__q">{question}</span>
            <span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <p>{answer}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: 64px;
  }
  .faq__intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    align-self: start;
    position: sticky;
    top: 112px;
  }
  .faq__list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }
  .faq details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .faq summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 26px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .faq__q {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .faq summary:hover .faq__q {
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .faq__icon {
    position: relative;
    flex: none;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    transition:
      background-color 0.2s,
      transform 0.25s;
  }
  .faq__icon::before,
  .faq__icon::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 12px;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: var(--text);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }
  .faq__icon::after {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg);
  }
  .faq details[open] .faq__icon {
    background: var(--ink);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .faq details[open] .faq__icon::before,
  .faq details[open] .faq__icon::after {
    background: #fff;
  }
  .faq details p {
    max-width: 640px;
    padding: 0 60px 28px 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 26px;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .faq__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .faq__intro {
      position: static;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .faq__q {
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 27px;
    }
    .faq details p {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
